# Sanjay Tutoring — GitHub Pages Package

## Upload
Upload **all files and the `assets` folder** to your GitHub repository.

The structure should be:

sanjay-tutoring/
├── index.html
└── assets/
    ├── python.svg
    ├── java.svg
    ├── sql.svg
    ├── spring-boot.svg
    ├── computer-science.svg
    ├── mathematics.svg
    ├── interview.svg
    ├── projects.svg
    ├── whatsapp.svg
    ├── email.svg
    ├── linkedin.svg
    └── instagram.svg

Then enable GitHub Pages:
Settings → Pages → Deploy from a branch → main → / (root).

## Important
The original `Sanjay_Tutoring_New_Website.html` was not modified.
This package contains a separate improved `index.html` plus local visual assets.
